        "Key": "8BEEEFB24631A629296CC7AAB6F2527C",
        "SourceString": "Darek Voss told me of a rare beast called the gambito, a sly creature that only the most patient can track. He claims catching its trail is a mark of worth among the Halmayans. I agreed to hunt it down, though I’ve never heard of such a thing before. My search begins near Sorwynn’s Cup.",
